Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.68,0:00:11.38,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:17.92,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.19,0:00:24.29,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:30.42,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:47.38,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.09,0:00:53.96,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.33,0:01:00.32,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.57,0:01:06.16,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.87,0:01:12.67,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.01,0:01:24.08,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.55,0:01:37.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字叫日暮戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.02,0:01:40.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我出生于一个历史很悠久很古老的神社里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.93,0:01:44.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个非常平凡的国三女生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.30,0:01:46.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过就在我十五岁生日那天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:49.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神社的井里突然出现了一个妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.77,0:01:52.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我带回到了战国时代
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.37,0:01:58.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在那里遇到了一个半妖少年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:02:00.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他名叫犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.71,0:02:02.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有可以增强妖怪法力的宝玉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.88,0:02:05.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.85,0:02:12.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了跟犬夜叉他们一起寻找散落各处的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.29,0:02:17.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开始来往于现代与战国之间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.03,0:02:26.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想借四魂之玉的力量满足自己的欲望
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.91,0:02:29.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫奈落的妖怪\N为了从犬夜叉的哥哥杀生丸的身上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.88,0:02:30.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得到完美的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.01,0:02:33.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,故意将杀生丸引进奈落城里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.08,0:02:39.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正当奈落打算吞了杀生丸\N将他化成自己的一部分的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.99,0:02:43.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉偏偏破了奈落的结界 跑进奈落城来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.39,0:02:46.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的 风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.06,0:02:49.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.69,0:02:51.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:53.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.70,0:03:00.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在最后出招了结他的时候...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.04,0:03:02.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蠢货！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.34,0:03:05.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为能从我手里逃走吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.84,0:03:08.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落利用珊瑚的弟弟琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.01,0:03:10.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种卑鄙手段 趁机逃之夭夭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.02,0:03:13.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从我们的面前消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.62,0:03:19.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第82话 奔波于现代与战国之间
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.43,0:03:25.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太可恶了 奈落那混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.13,0:03:29.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道以后他都不再回这座城了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.53,0:03:31.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.20,0:03:34.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然结界都被你破除了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.57,0:03:38.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再移动城堡也就毫无意义了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.75,0:03:41.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.45,0:03:46.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的话 说不定真的可以砍死奈落这个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:50.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只差一步就可以杀了他了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.29,0:03:51.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,气死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.50,0:04:04.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好啊 能回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.57,0:04:08.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.87,0:04:10.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能回到了这个安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.31,0:04:12.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轻轻松松的念书了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:15.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉有点对不起犬夜叉他们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.58,0:04:18.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道大家现在正在做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.39,0:04:26.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个公式后天一定会考哦 大家要牢牢的记住
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.09,0:04:28.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃…模拟考
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.97,0:04:36.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都什么时候了 还在担心别人的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.90,0:04:39.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只剩两天 要是不赶快抱抱佛脚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.47,0:04:41.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候恐怕要补考那就惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.91,0:04:43.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 可以走了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.64,0:04:45.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:47.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.91,0:04:49.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你啦 借我笔记本
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.55,0:04:52.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你这么说…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.48,0:04:53.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呐…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.05,0:04:56.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我们自己也要复习呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.29,0:04:57.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于那拜托一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:05:00.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只借一下就还给你们总可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.86,0:05:03.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫你这么弱不禁风一天到晚生病
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.29,0:05:04.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很糟糕的说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.86,0:05:05.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是说嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.06,0:05:07.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道你们一定会帮我的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.67,0:05:08.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就拿去影印一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.73,0:05:10.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就还给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.57,0:05:11.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.07,0:05:14.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真拿你没办法 见你说得这么可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.31,0:05:15.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就谢谢咯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.94,0:05:17.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.94,0:05:18.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:20.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.18,0:05:25.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开动了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.66,0:05:36.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.69,0:05:38.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在胡思乱想啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.70,0:05:39.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:41.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想什么还用说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.53,0:05:43.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不是那个 爱吃醋的小太保是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.67,0:05:45.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.67,0:05:46.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想别的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:48.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别装了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.47,0:05:50.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟他到底怎么样啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.11,0:05:52.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事到底怎么样啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.68,0:05:54.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我问你发展到什么程度
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.05,0:05:57.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前几天才见过他哥哥而已
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.35,0:05:58.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说见过他哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.85,0:06:00.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看他哥哥恐怕也是太保吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.62,0:06:02.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他哥哥也很厉害吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.22,0:06:03.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.35,0:06:05.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想他哥哥应该更厉害一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.06,0:06:10.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们兄弟俩只要一碰面经常都会打架呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.56,0:06:11.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很危险的人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.23,0:06:14.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对是很危险的人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.57,0:06:16.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你打算继续这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.80,0:06:19.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我担心你将来吃亏
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.87,0:06:22.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒认为爱可以克服一切障碍
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.21,0:06:24.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇我支持你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:28.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.58,0:06:30.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没…没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:31.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我借走笔记了 谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:38.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.26,0:06:40.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大学生正在考试
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.59,0:06:42.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家的目的都跟戈薇一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.59,0:06:44.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那怎么办？要去排队吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.83,0:06:47.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是影印去哪里都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.47,0:06:51.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到其他地方去印吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.60,0:06:54.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么到处都这么多人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.27,0:06:55.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞么鬼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.77,0:06:57.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.61,0:06:59.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.74,0:07:00.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜拜 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.18,0:07:02.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.48,0:07:04.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.28,0:07:06.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.79,0:07:10.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.19,0:07:13.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都是些没有义气的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.30,0:07:21.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢死了 戈薇那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.07,0:07:23.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是说好了 马上就会回来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.20,0:07:26.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说过要在那边待两三天才回来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.70,0:07:28.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 稍安勿躁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.81,0:07:31.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么每一个人都好像没事一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.58,0:07:33.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落从我们手中跑掉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.38,0:07:35.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又不是第一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:37.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:41.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也应该让自己休息一下比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.79,0:07:43.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你在胡说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.82,0:07:45.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不像你们人类一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.16,0:07:47.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一点都不觉得疲倦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.16,0:07:49.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.09,0:07:52.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们都跟着你走的话 我们就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.90,0:07:54.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你自己累了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.73,0:07:55.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.18,0:08:07.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.88,0:08:08.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.88,0:08:12.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的邪气仍然躲在阴暗处
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.45,0:08:14.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那以后 我一直让那些死魂虫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.09,0:08:17.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寻找他那股邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.42,0:08:20.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次连它张开结界的迹象都找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.06,0:08:23.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种程度的邪气…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.70,0:08:26.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟是怎么藏起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:34.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.07,0:08:38.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上从琥珀身上取下四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.81,0:08:42.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还以为这个小子只是个普通的傀儡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.85,0:08:45.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他却没有杀了那小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.95,0:08:48.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也没有被杀生丸给杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.86,0:08:56.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.33,0:08:59.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再这么继续反抗奈落下去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.33,0:09:01.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你恐怕没多少日子可活了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:05.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然 我也没资格说别人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.98,0:09:20.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:22.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连琥珀也一起不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.13,0:09:32.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.50,0:09:35.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.14,0:09:39.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.91,0:09:43.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师大人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.28,0:09:49.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来弥勒法师特地去安慰珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.11,0:09:51.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是这样没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.02,0:09:56.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇早就跟我说过\N珊瑚一定在偷偷期待琥珀回来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:10:00.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 我可以坐过一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.39,0:10:04.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还在担心你弟弟的事对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.16,0:10:07.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.93,0:10:11.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这么说有点强人所难
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.80,0:10:13.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你真的要放宽心才好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.93,0:10:14.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.04,0:10:19.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我能够了解你的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.68,0:10:27.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然 你是不是想一个人静一静
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.08,0:10:29.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.32,0:10:31.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要说的就这些
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.23,0:10:31.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:35.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是这样 法师大人那样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.79,0:10:40.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,借着安慰人家 然后做出一些色狼的行为…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:44.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.20,0:10:45.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果等待着这个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.07,0:10:47.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛不早点跟我说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.63,0:10:48.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊~~
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:53.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天的声音特别清脆好听
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.85,0:10:56.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个都只会偷懒 一点都不知道上进
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:11:01.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然 读书还是要靠自己
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:10.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全看不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.00,0:11:12.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个时候就应该
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.10,0:11:15.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 请问哲子在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.23,0:11:16.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问也是一个办法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.00,0:11:20.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.01,0:11:22.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.37,0:11:23.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.11,0:11:30.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么打这个电话啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.12,0:11:34.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐 你的课本
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.12,0:11:38.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果昨天一整天什么都没有做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.02,0:11:40.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 姐姐 告诉你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.39,0:11:41.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.03,0:11:43.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要和我说话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.53,0:11:45.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会忘记好不容易记住的东西的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.86,0:11:47.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何今天我一定要记住
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.13,0:11:49.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗哥哥他来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.83,0:11:50.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:53.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.54,0:11:56.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你太慢了 我就来接你了…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.27,0:11:57.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 马上跟我回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.91,0:11:59.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在那里说什么梦话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.54,0:12:00.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天就要考试了！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.15,0:12:02.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在生什么气啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:04.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.05,0:12:08.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我听好 绝对不可以到外面去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.42,0:12:10.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖待在家里你听到了没有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:13.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.56,0:12:14.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.06,0:12:18.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样 我傍晚就回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.30,0:12:21.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.67,0:12:22.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇已经走了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.07,0:12:24.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.80,0:12:27.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇忘了把便当带走了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.44,0:12:28.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便当
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.81,0:12:29.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.94,0:12:32.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能帮我送过去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.94,0:12:34.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.42,0:12:44.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要沿着戈薇身上的气味找
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.19,0:12:45.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定很快可以追上她的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:48.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮忙 马上给我抓住他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:53.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.10,0:12:57.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚 全都给我闪开
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.21,0:13:06.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 你活得不耐烦了是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.82,0:13:21.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来戈薇她们这个时代也安全不到哪里去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:28.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次又怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.63,0:13:59.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在发什么呆啊 快过来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.64,0:14:15.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看什么看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.19,0:14:25.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是耳朵啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.39,0:14:28.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.29,0:14:30.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.43,0:14:36.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大哥哥 谢谢你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:39.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 这世界怎么乱成这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.22,0:15:00.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底什么事啊 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.59,0:15:02.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.60,0:15:05.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.46,0:15:07.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉怎么会在这里出现呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.24,0:15:21.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.98,0:15:31.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚是你叫坐下的吧 麻烦你站起来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.49,0:15:34.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.26,0:15:41.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.50,0:15:43.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出门前不是跟你说过 叫你千万不要出门
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:45.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的很烦耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.27,0:15:46.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有什么办法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.77,0:15:48.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是有人托我来的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.37,0:15:50.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人托你来的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.51,0:15:53.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.25,0:15:55.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我的便当耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.38,0:15:58.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道专程替我送便当来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.98,0:16:02.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.49,0:16:04.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.66,0:16:09.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都挤成一堆了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.77,0:16:16.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在家里 我肯定无法集中注意力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.13,0:16:19.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少在天黑前我得待在图书馆里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.27,0:16:22.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再不快点念就糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.31,0:16:25.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮同学
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.68,0:16:26.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.81,0:16:29.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的肋间神经痛好多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.55,0:16:30.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.82,0:16:32.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在还年轻
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.28,0:16:34.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以应该多注意保重你的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.55,0:16:38.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是一些对健康有益的食谱 是我特别搜集来的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.06,0:16:40.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拿回去试一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.33,0:16:42.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.29,0:16:44.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:51.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条这个人真的好细心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.67,0:16:53.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.07,0:16:55.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我没有想到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.07,0:16:59.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以向北条同学借笔记来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.85,0:17:02.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我 北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.43,0:17:16.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.89,0:17:17.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.83,0:17:19.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 突然想起来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.60,0:17:21.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有个中药偏方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.50,0:17:23.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说对各种病都很有帮助呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.90,0:17:25.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.17,0:17:27.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说 戈薇同学
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.77,0:17:30.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身体健康呢最重要的是情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:32.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要让自己的生活有规律
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.94,0:17:35.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三餐也要定时定量哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.11,0:17:37.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:42.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇同学 记得一定要吃哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.19,0:17:46.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一等 北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.13,0:17:51.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.73,0:17:53.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.43,0:17:57.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果我还是没有借到他的笔记
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.44,0:18:00.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐  快看！快看！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.04,0:18:04.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.48,0:18:05.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像刚刚说的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.48,0:18:07.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一位身穿红衣身轻如燕的少年
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.11,0:18:10.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮忙抓住了银行抢匪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.58,0:18:11.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.98,0:18:17.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不止这样 这位少年还救了\N一个来不急逃离火海的小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.22,0:18:19.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥好酷哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.56,0:18:23.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据被救的小女孩形容\N这就是那位年轻人的画像
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.46,0:18:29.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是刚刚我戴的帽子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.70,0:18:31.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.67,0:18:33.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去学校之前你到底做过什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.10,0:18:36.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说起来...这个箱子是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.59,0:18:53.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:55.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这么忙的时候还…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.29,0:18:57.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.10,0:18:59.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,草太 你进来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.60,0:19:01.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐 什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.90,0:19:03.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你帮我陪犬夜叉哥哥玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.53,0:19:04.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.80,0:19:06.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥 我们去泡澡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.74,0:19:07.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.81,0:19:11.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.51,0:19:17.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好烫 搞什么鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.25,0:19:19.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不能出去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.12,0:19:21.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肥皂都还没有冲掉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.32,0:19:22.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你少罗唆 我不玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.63,0:19:23.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.29,0:19:25.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫你出去你听到了没有
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.63,0:19:28.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 戈…薇…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.03,0:19:35.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公式又忘得一干二净了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.67,0:19:40.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚饭要吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.74,0:19:43.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安静下来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.78,0:19:46.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.41,0:19:47.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舌头好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.55,0:19:49.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给他吃咖哩了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.81,0:19:50.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是太辣了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.02,0:19:51.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,痛 痛 痛...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.02,0:19:53.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫你自己像饿死鬼一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.85,0:19:55.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到东西就往嘴里塞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.54,0:20:15.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.74,0:20:18.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？ 我可没有吵着你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.51,0:20:21.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这样一直安静的看着我 反而感觉不自在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.31,0:20:23.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你还是躺下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.48,0:20:24.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苯蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.85,0:20:26.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才是应该看着前面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.18,0:20:27.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,认真读书
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.72,0:20:30.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天我们要回去的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.39,0:20:32.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是~
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.69,0:20:38.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子 难道真打算整晚都盯着我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.73,0:20:40.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他当然可以做到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.20,0:20:43.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可是精力旺盛的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.41,0:20:54.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然睡着了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.58,0:20:58.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不晓得这小子搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.78,0:21:02.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他给我的学习添了这么多麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.36,0:21:13.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉这样的睡面
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.80,0:21:16.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是第一次看见
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.77,0:21:24.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也对~
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:29.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实最辛苦的人是犬夜叉了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.45,0:21:34.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少今天晚上可以安心的睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.31,0:21:49.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 他们回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.68,0:21:52.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 原来你昨天晚上在戈薇家过夜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.45,0:21:53.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.71,0:21:54.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无精打采的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:55.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不是都怪你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.08,0:21:58.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫你昨天晚上整晚都霸占我的床
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.05,0:22:01.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且连模拟考都考砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.42,0:22:05.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 太倒霉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.73,0:22:08.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好天气啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.47,0:22:21.14,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.31,0:22:28.27,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.42,0:22:34.45,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.72,0:22:40.82,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.03,0:22:47.59,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.84,0:22:54.74,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.21,0:23:01.61,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.75,0:23:08.35,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.56,0:23:14.96,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.20,0:23:21.86,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.20,0:23:28.54,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.81,0:23:35.54,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.76,0:23:47.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在开始发问
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.99,0:23:51.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片根本不在奈落手里\N你说会是谁拿走了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.47,0:23:53.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我数数 在琥珀背上有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.70,0:23:55.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇手里还有三个
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.67,0:23:56.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后还有…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.44,0:23:57.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停 时间到
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.70,0:23:59.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族的钢牙 两只脚上也有两个
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.11,0:24:01.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万一钢牙也被奈落抓到的话
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.18,0:24:04.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 奈落现在不知道躲到什么地方去了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.75,0:24:06.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么… 那又是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.48,0:24:07.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.95,0:24:09.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族少女和月虹的约定
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.92,0:24:11.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才说妖狼族少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.45,0:24:15.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可别忘了还有钢牙呢
